## Environment variables for Codex CLI server

# OpenAI API key (required)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key

## MongoDB configuration
# When running MongoDB and Codex in the same container, defaults to localhost:27017
# Or if using an external MongoDB service, override host and port:
# MONGODB_HOST=127.0.0.1
# MONGODB_PORT=27017
# Or a full URI (overrides host/port):
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://username:password@host:port

# (Optional) MongoDB database name, defaults to 'codex'
#MONGODB_DB=codex

# (Optional) Server port, defaults to 3000
#PORT=3000